"The normal form of a variant of the game of Figure 8, showing that fully stable equilibrium does not satisfy admissibility: the unique fully stable set is the full interval from (T,L) to (T,R), but only (T,L) is admissible.

Player II's strategy Z is Z at the first move; L and R are continue at the first move followed by L or R."

